===Etymology===
Origin {{unk.|lang=en|title=unknown}}. Perhaps of {{etyl|gmq|en}} origin, related to {{cog|da|skyttel|t=shuttle, child's toy}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɪtəl|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One of the [[wooden]] [[target]]s used in [[skittles]].

===Verb===
{{en-verb|skittl}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[play]] [[skittles]].
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To beat comprehensively.
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To knock down.
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To use as a recreational [[drug]] a certain over-the-counter cough medication that is taken orally and whose tablets are said to resemble [[w:Skittles (confectionery)|Skittles]].

